# Remote access V1
# Publish Laravel Web only. Keep Agent/PostgreSQL/Qdrant/Ollama private.
# Replace the hostname with a real DNS name and terminate HTTPS here.
#
# Example:
# app.example.com {
#     reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8001
# }
#
# Do NOT add public reverse_proxy entries for:
# - 127.0.0.1:8000 (Agent) until a dedicated client authentication contract exists
# - 127.0.0.1:5433 (PostgreSQL)
# - 127.0.0.1:6333/6334 (Qdrant)
# - 127.0.0.1:11434 (Ollama)
